### Create Calendar Event
POST {{url}}/calendar-events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "id": 0,
  "organizationId": 1,
  "startDate": "2025-10-07T15:30:00Z",
  "endDate": "2025-10-07T15:35:00Z",
  "patientId": 1,
  "description": "Consulta de rotina",
  "isDeleted": false
}

### Update Calendar Event
PUT {{url}}/calendar-events/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "organizationId": 456,
  "startDate": "2025-10-08T14:30:00Z",
  "endDate": "2025-10-08T14:35:00Z",
  "patientId": 123,
  "description": "Consulta de acompanhamento",
  "isDeleted": false
}

### Get Calendar Event Details
GET {{url}}/calendar-events/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### Search Calendar Events - Basic
GET {{url}}/calendar-events?startDate=2025-10-06T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-10-06T23:59:59Z
Authorization: {{token}}

### Search Calendar Events - With Organization ID
GET {{url}}/calendar-events?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z&organizationId=456
Authorization: {{token}}

### Search Calendar Events - With Created By Filter
GET {{url}}/calendar-events?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z&createdBy=1
Authorization: {{token}}

### Search Calendar Events - Current Month
GET {{url}}/calendar-events?startDate=2024-10-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2024-10-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: {{token}}

### Create Calendar Event without Description (Optional Field)
POST {{url}}/calendar-events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "id": 0,
  "organizationId": 456,
  "startDate": "2024-01-16T09:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2024-01-16T10:30:00Z",
  "patientId": 124,
  "description": null,
  "isDeleted": false
}

### Update Calendar Event - Mark as Deleted
PUT {{url}}/calendar-events/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "id": 2,
  "organizationId": 456,
  "startDate": "2024-01-16T09:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2024-01-16T10:30:00Z",
  "patientId": 124,
  "description": "Evento cancelado",
  "isDeleted": true
}


